1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:04,050
Doctor Pidge, at your service.

2
00:00:04,050 --> 00:00:12,050
Pigeons were trained to spot signs of cancer in images.

3
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:18,050
We recognise human faces. We tell letters apart.

4
00:00:18,050 --> 00:00:24,050
And you called me a bird-brain?

5
00:00:24,050 --> 00:00:29,470
Call me Doctor. Payment: breadcrumbs.
